{"id":"654279","name":"桂花烤板栗","author":"莉莉呀Lilly","authorId":"12967468","desc":"","cover":"images/654279/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"板栗","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"桂花","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"板栗清水洗好捞出。","img":"images/654279/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"晾干后用板栗夹开口。","img":"images/654279/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"夹中间一道破壳，没有夹子可以用菜刀切。","img":"images/654279/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入20克食用油。","img":"images/654279/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入烤箱烤200度烤25分钟，破壳位置朝上摆。","img":"images/654279/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备一个大碗放50克白糖。","img":"images/654279/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"克清水。","img":"images/654279/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克食用油。","img":"images/654279/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"克桂花。","img":"images/654279/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"破壳的板栗倒入碗中搅拌均匀至每颗都裹上糖和油。","img":"images/654279/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再次放入烤箱200度烤5分钟，破壳朝上。","img":"images/654279/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅开吃，壳一掰就开，非常好剥。","img":"images/654279/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"微波炉烤热后烫手注意用夹子。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}